sgx: build src/sgx for the gallium driver

The gallium driver uses the ISA, PDS and state-word code in src/sgx, and
the compiler in src/sgx/compiler: src/meson.build enters src/sgx for the
driver as well as for -Dtools=sgx.

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index fad4238..929580d 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -104,7 +104,7 @@ endif
 if with_gallium_panfrost or with_gallium_lima or with_panfrost_vk or with_tools.contains('panfrost')
   subdir('panfrost')
 endif
-if with_tools.contains('sgx')
+if with_gallium_sgx or with_tools.contains('sgx')
   subdir('sgx')
 endif
 if with_microsoft_clc or with_gallium_d3d12 or with_spirv_to_dxil or with_microsoft_vk
